msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../.conda/lib/python3.14/site-packages/pygmt/src/grdfill.py:docstring
#: of pygmt.src.grdfill.grdfill:3
msgid ""
"Read a grid that presumably has unfilled holes that the user wants to fill "
"in some fashion. Holes are identified by NaN values but this criteria can be "
"changed via the ``hole`` parameter. There are several different algorithms "
"that can be used to replace the hole values. If no holes are found the "
"original unchanged grid is returned."
msgstr ""

