msgid ""
"*ret* -- If ``inquire`` is ``True``, return the bounds of each hole as a 2-D "
"numpy array. Otherwise, the return type depends on whether the ``outgrid`` "
"parameter is set:  - :class:`xarray.DataArray` if ``outgrid`` is not set - "
"``None`` if ``outgrid`` is set (grid output will be stored in the file set "
"by   ``outgrid``)"
